{"title": "Loving Protection", "pageid": 28299, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Loving_Protection", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Loving Protection</b> is a passive feature that heals you a bit when your hit points get low.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short Rest</a>, if you are below 50% <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> and take damage, you gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"8 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 8 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>. \n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">Can only have temporary hit points from one source.</span></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Temporary_Hit_Points_.288.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Temporary_Hit_Points_(8)\"> Condition: Temporary Hit Points (8) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points_(8)_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points (8) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Temporary Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points_(8)_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points (8) (Condition)\">Temporary Hit Points</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Kept from death's door by a brief magical boost. Gained <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"8 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 8 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glowing_Shield\" title=\"Glowing Shield\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Glowing_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Glowing_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Glowing_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Glowing_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Glowing_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Glowing_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Glowing_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Glowing_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Glowing_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Glowing_Shield\" title=\"Glowing Shield\">Glowing Shield</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215718\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited